WEBVTT

00:30.671 --> 00:34.955
The city lights are fading in the glass Watching

00:35.035 --> 00:38.959
the broken billboards flying past Ten years of

00:38.999 --> 00:43.123
playing out a scripted scene Caught in the teeth

00:43.183 --> 00:48.299
of the machine I drop the window, let the cold air

00:48.519 --> 00:52.403
in Shedding the ghost of who I've always been

00:52.804 --> 00:56.267
There's a million voices trying to pull me back

00:56.647 --> 01:00.731
But the tires are humming on the open track Yeah,

01:00.751 --> 01:06.116
the tires are humming on the open track And it's

01:06.176 --> 01:11.240
just static On the dial, turning the knob for

01:11.320 --> 01:15.402
another mile Fading out the echoes of the things

01:15.442 --> 01:20.865
they said Cutting the wire inside my head Out

01:20.945 --> 01:26.248
here on the highway, running wild Leaving the

01:26.268 --> 01:28.810
static on the dial

01:31.497 --> 01:34.478
They try to tell us what the frequency should be,

01:35.319 --> 01:39.801
selling a plastic kind of fantasy. But out in the

01:39.861 --> 01:43.942
desert where the signal dies, you finally see

01:44.163 --> 01:48.404
the open skies. Heaven is holding down the

01:48.464 --> 01:53.271
rhythm line. Tyler is keeping us right on time

01:53.671 --> 01:57.075
There's a million voices trying to pull me back

01:57.516 --> 02:01.560
But the tires are humming on the open track Yeah,

02:01.600 --> 02:06.958
the tires are humming on the open track And it's

02:07.018 --> 02:12.062
just static on the dial Turning the knob for

02:12.122 --> 02:16.285
another mile Fading out the echoes of the things

02:16.305 --> 02:21.728
they said Cutting the wire inside my head Out

02:21.788 --> 02:27.092
here on the highway, running wild Leaving the

02:27.112 --> 02:29.734
static on the dial

02:45.099 --> 02:52.788
Tune it out, let the frequency fade

02:55.531 --> 02:59.836
Tune it out, leave the mess that they made

03:03.634 --> 03:08.096
Cause it's just static On the dial Turning the

03:08.136 --> 03:12.898
knob for another mile Fading out the echoes of

03:12.918 --> 03:17.620
the things they said Cutting the wire inside my

03:17.680 --> 03:22.042
head Out here on the highway Running wild

03:23.582 --> 03:28.124
Leaving the static on the dial Just static

03:30.245 --> 03:31.526
Fading away

03:35.025 --> 03:39.344
Nothing but the open road today

